      "description": "Who vouches for the board a run flashes and the instrument it powers or measures with: the guard protocols a capture consults, the operator guard the command line uses, and the rail and supply requests a power run selects.\n\nEvery name on this page is imported from `helia_profiler`.\n\n**API tier:** `experimental`\n\nGenerated from the `src/helia_profiler` tree `__DOCS_SOURCE_TREE__`.",
